	(text "All panel inputs: pull-up at the connector, ESD array, series R + RC filter into the logic.\nSwitch contacts go to GND (active low). Limit switches are NC to GND, so a broken wire reads as 'hit'.\nOutput encoder (LPD3806, NPN open collector) powered from 5 V, pulled up to 3.3 V (safe for the RP2040 + TMC5160)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
